Short:        ARexx script for using Amiga AutoDocs (AmigaGuide) with GoldEd v3.x+
Author:       Manolis S Pappas (mpappas@acropolis.net)
Uploader:     Manolis S Pappas (mpappas acropolis net)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

        This archive contains an ARexx script or browsing though Amiga AutoDocs in
AmigaGuide format, from GoldEd v3.x+. It can be used straight with SAS/C v6.57 and
with a few modification with other compilers too!

        Remember to download the file "sc656man.lha" in order to find out how you
can convert your autodocs in AmigaGuide format.

        This program is FREEWARE, but it is copyrighted by Manolis S Pappas.
        
